{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“Hilbert 第 21 问题”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Hilbert第21问题"},0]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p>Hilbert 第 21 问题, 又称 Riemann–Hilbert 问题, 问是否存在一个线性微分方程具有给定的单值群.</p>\n"}}